### List calendar events for a month
# Run Azurite and the Azure Functions host before sending this request.
# Select the local environment in the Visual Studio HTTP editor.
# Create at least one June 2026 calendar event first if a non-empty response is needed.

GET {{HostAddress}}/api/calendar-events?year=2026&month=6
x-functions-key: {{FunctionKey}}

### List calendar events for a likely empty month
# The expected response is 200 OK with [] when local storage has no matching rows.

GET {{HostAddress}}/api/calendar-events?year=2099&month=1
x-functions-key: {{FunctionKey}}

### Invalid list query
# The expected response is 400 Bad Request.

GET {{HostAddress}}/api/calendar-events?year=2026&month=13
x-functions-key: {{FunctionKey}}
